WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
The administrator opens the live placement board and reviews candidate queues.

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
The board is narrowed to compact cards with wanted alerts.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
The candidate-opportunities workspace brings urgent decisions together.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.000
Records can be maintained without returning to a spreadsheet.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.500
System readiness shows what the placement team should resolve before going live.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.000
The public page shares aggregate placement progress without exposing candidate identities.
